  "solution": "Pattern followed is :\n\nFor 3*4 = 21,\n\n3 × (3 + 4) = 3 × 7 = 21\n\nFor 4*5 = 36,\n\n4 × (4 + 5) = 4 × 9 = 36\n\nFor 5*6 = 55\n\n5 × (5 + 6) = 5 × 11 = 55\n\nSimilarly,\n\nFor 6*7\n\n6 × (6 + 7) = 6 × 13 = 78\n\n**Alternate solution : **\n\nThe pattern followed is,\n\nFor 3*4 = 21,\n\n3 × 4 = 12\n\n12 + 12 = 24\n\n24 – 3 = 21\n\nAnd,\n\nFor 4*5 = 36,\n\n4 × 5 = 20\n\n20 + 20 = 40\n\n40 – 4 = 36\n\nSimilarly,\n\nFor 6*7\n\n6 × 7 = 42\n\n42 + 42 = 84\n\n84 – 6 = **78**\n\nHence, “78” is the correct answer.",
